### Page 4 of 4

```text
Page 4 of 4
Section 2.  Upon the effective date of this ordinance, no person shall be issued an annual
license and no application to renew an annual license shall be approved under Sections 10.82.030
or 10.82.040 of the municipal code of the City of Cheyenne, Wyoming. No person shall be entitled
to administrative review under this section. This section shall not apply to monthly licenses as
otherwise authorized under this ordinance.

Section 3.  Sections, paragraphs, sentences, clauses, and phrases of this ordinance are
severable. If any section, paragraph, sentence, clause, or phrase of this ordinance is declared
unconstitutional or otherwise unlawful, such declaration shall not affect any of the remaining
sections, paragraphs, sentences, clauses, and phrases.

Section 4.  This ordinance shall be in full force and effect upon approval and publication.

